  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACTED is a French based international CSO. The overall objective of   this intervention is to increase opportunities for civic and          political participation for youth in Libya. It is supporting freedom  of expression and focusing on strengthening actors of change.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ACTED &#xe4;r en internationel CSO baserad i Frankrike. Det &#xf6;vergripande   m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;det till ACTED &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka m&#xf6;jligheten f&#xf6;r Libyska        ungdomar att delta politiskt och i samh&#xe4;llslivet. Insatsen bidrar     genom att st&#xf6;tta f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsakt&#xf6;rer och bidrar till &#xf6;kad              yttrandefrihet.</narrative>
  </description>
